16
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.370
Well I can collect the money, I'm with you.

17
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.490
Yeah, but--
You don't trust me?

18
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:35.490
I trust you.

19
