28
00:00:55.443 --> 00:00:57.573
Okay.
Some say, the world.

29
00:00:57.573 --> 00:00:59.140
Okay.
Whoa!

30
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.690
Hey, what do I say to him?

31
00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:02.280
Tried to hit us.
Look at that!

32
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.881
That was crazy, what do I yell at people?

33
