That mean you crazy.

37
00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:11.673
Crazy, (speaking Haitian Creole)!

38
00:01:11.673 --> 00:01:12.506
Yeah, (speaking Haitian Creole).

39
00:01:12.506 --> 00:01:14.000
Are you married?
Yeah, I'm married.

40
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.020
I have eight children.
You have eight children?

41
00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.510
Yes, sir.
Oh my God!

42
00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.320
My God.

43
00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.240
But they cost too much.
How do you have time

44
00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.000
