47
00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:30.409
It is.

48
00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:31.651
You (speaking Haitian Creole)!

49
00:01:31.651 --> 00:01:32.484
You (speaking Haitian Creole)!

50
00:01:32.484 --> 00:01:33.530
Was that it?

51
