54
00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.750
It says Snacks.
Snacks.

55
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.470
That's right, that's fast food.

56
00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:43.160
We gotta get some business here, we're not...

57
