77
00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.640 line:15%
Yes, I do.
Would you like a free ride?

78
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.280 line:15%
I don't care, we'll take you to your house.

79
00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.400
We'll take you to your house, don't worry.

80
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.950
we'll take you to your house.

81
00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.250
How close is your house?
It's right there.

82
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.885
So we're headed the wrong way from your house.

83
00:02:42.885 --> 00:02:45.270
(speaking Haitian Creole)
(horn honks)

84
00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.870
It's free, it's free.
(speaking Haitian Creole)

85
00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.310
Come on in.

86
