Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, you okay?

89
00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:55.463
You okay?

90
00:02:55.463 --> 00:02:57.420
Hello, hello.
Okay.

91
00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.230
Bon soir.
Bon soir.

92
00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:00.620
