Yeah.

94
00:03:05.296 --> 00:03:06.390
Team Coco, Team Coco.
Hey, Team Coco!

95
00:03:08.275 --> 00:03:10.384
He knows Team Coco!

96
00:03:10.384 --> 00:03:12.780
He knows Team Coco, that's crazy!

97
00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.550
That's fantastic, thank you.

98
